{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25416","headline":"尊师是桃源黄先生传法弟子常见尊师称先师灵迹今重赋此诗兼寄题黄先生旧馆 · 李德裕","name":"尊师是桃源黄先生传法弟子常见尊师称先师灵迹今重赋此诗兼寄题黄先生旧馆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"後学方成市，吾师又上宾。\n洞天应不夜，源树秪如春。\n棋客留童子，山精避直神。\n无因握石髓，及与养生人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25416.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25416","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}